label "Hash chained audit log diagram"
canvas 460 240
box r1 14 30 124 66 "record 1|who, what, verdict|hash: none"
box r2 166 30 124 66 "record 2|who, what, verdict|hash of record 1"
box r3 318 30 124 66 "record 3|who, what, verdict|hash of record 2"
arrow r1 r2
arrow r2 r3
box ver 148 150 160 48 "verifier|recomputes every link" acc
arrow ver r1
arrow ver r2
arrow ver r3
note "append-only: changing any record breaks every hash after it"
